# Large data files
/data_raw/
*.joblib
*.csv

# NOTE: the `/models/` DIRECTORY is not excluded here on purpose. A negation
# cannot re-include a path inside an excluded directory, so excluding
# `/models/` would make the rule below dead. Exclude the model FILES instead
# and re-include the one small file that is a contract rather than a model.
/models/best_rf_clean.joblib

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The feature list is a CONTRACT, not a model artefact. It is 401 bytes of
# plain strings naming the 26 columns the model was trained on, and it is what
# lets the test suite run without the 1.05 GiB model (item 2.3). Leaving it
# gitignored meant 66 tests SKIPPED in CI, which dropped coverage under the 70%
# floor and failed the pipeline - the floor was calibrated against a local run
# that happened to have the file on disk.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!models/feature_cols_clean.joblib

# Python / virtual env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Test / coverage artefacts
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
